      "created_at": "2013-04-09T06:35:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was looking at the incapacitated side of Freedom Wraith online when I noticed something odd about Spite. I went to the bio and double checked to confirm. This might mean nothing, but in the Freedom 6 future Spite's hair seems to have changed from Black to Brown. Possibly it is a different Spite, hence why Iron Legacy has him working for him, or maybe just too many drug whack outs, but very few details like this are completely meaningless so I thought I'd mention it</p>",
